    "title": "Bias can enter at every stage\u2014measure and mitigate it",
    "description": "Bias can enter through data selection and representation, learned model associations, or deployment framing and feedback loops. Mitigate at data, training, alignment, and inference stages. StereoSet reports LMS and SS and combines them with ICAT; Regard measures social perception."
